{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09212","headline":"荅畅校书当 · 韦应物","name":"荅畅校书当","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶然弃官去，投迹在田中。\n日出照茅屋，园林养愚蒙。\n虽云无一资，罇酌会不空。\n且忻百谷成，仰叹造化功。\n出入与民伍，作事靡不同。\n时伐南涧竹，夜还沣水东。\n贫蹇自成退，岂爲高人踪。\n览君金玉篇，彩色发我容。\n日月欲爲报，方春已徂冬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}